Comment: 0,0:02:35.91,0:02:37.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-op- 
Comment: 0,0:09:41.99,0:09:42.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-eye-
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.81,0:00:12.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,All right. 
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.95,0:00:18.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That one broke too?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.33,0:00:21.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'd rather buy a new one...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.36,0:00:25.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This one's still good if I can fix it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.85,0:00:28.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We don't need a new one.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.24,0:00:32.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,How's school going?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.43,0:00:34.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay. 
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.58,0:00:37.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You've at least been going, right? You'll pass this semester?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.30,0:00:39.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Of course. 
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.61,0:00:40.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's great. 
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.97,0:00:45.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're always working so hard. 
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.82,0:00:49.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning, Kobato! 
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.55,0:00:50.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning{\fscx200}-{\fscx100}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.72,0:00:53.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato tripped again! 
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.71,0:00:55.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Stop tripping!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.41,0:00:57.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you okay, Kobato? 
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.57,0:00:57.41,Default-kobaalt,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh man... 
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.66,0:01:00.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Why do you keep tripping over your own feet?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.76,0:01:05.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Owie... 
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.39,0:01:09.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you. 
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.04,0:02:49.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto! 
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.98,0:02:54.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll help out! Let me do it! 
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.07,0:02:56.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Fine, whatever. 
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.47,0:02:58.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay! 
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.95,0:03:06.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Um, Fujimoto? 
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.33,0:03:11.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Mind if I ask you something? 
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.62,0:03:14.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto? 
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.75,0:03:19.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shut up and get back to work. I don't have time right now for your gum-flapping. 
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.46,0:03:20.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.69,0:03:24.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What is it, anyway? 
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.48,0:03:25.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Er? 
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.72,0:03:28.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What did you want to ask me? 
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.75,0:03:31.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, um... 
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.12,0:03:35.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's about that strange phone call earlier. 
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.37,0:03:40.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Why can't I tell Miss Sayaka about it? 
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.97,0:03:43.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You just can't. 
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.87,0:03:46.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Why can't I? 
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.51,0:03:50.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If you can't keep quiet, you should just go away. 
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.64,0:03:55.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She'll be worried if she hears about it. 
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.50,0:03:57.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's why.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.62,0:04:00.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Miss Sayaka will be worried? 
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.22,0:04:19.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you here to help out, or just to get in the way? 
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.12,0:04:27.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's wrong, Kobato? 
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.46,0:04:32.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I got Fujimoto mad again. 
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.83,0:04:34.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He's mad? 
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.22,0:04:34.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. 
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.29,0:04:39.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I always get in his way. 
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.55,0:04:45.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You should apologize. Let's go do it together. 
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.33,0:05:05.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sure he's just mad because he's worried about you. 
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.55,0:05:07.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Really? 
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.03,0:05:09.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah! Cheer up! 
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.88,0:05:13.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Mama always says she's mad because she wants me to be a good boy. 
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.97,0:05:19.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's right. I'll apologize and ask to help again.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.92,0:05:23.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? He's not here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.59,0:05:31.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's this? 
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.50,0:05:35.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, that has to be Fujimoto's report. 
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.14,0:05:37.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Report?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.66,0:05:40.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I think it's due today.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.28,0:05:42.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Can you bring it to him? 
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.69,0:05:44.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Me? 
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.86,0:05:47.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I think he really needs it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.11,0:05:49.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll bring it to him! 
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.49,0:05:57.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't get too excited. 
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.44,0:06:03.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm always getting in his way. I want to show him I can do something right for once. 
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.94,0:06:09.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto's university is this way, right? 
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.16,0:06:12.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Didn't you ask directions!?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.60,0:06:13.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah! 
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.87,0:06:16.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But wait, what's a university? 
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.17,0:06:19.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What, you don't even know that!? 
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.08,0:06:24.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, at this point, I shouldn't be too surprised at your lack of common sense. 
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.80,0:06:28.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,A university's a place where you study complicated things. 
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.86,0:06:30.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Study? 
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.32,0:06:30.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. 
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.27,0:06:34.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe there's something he wants to do, or a career he aspires to.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.87,0:06:36.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Something he wants to do? 
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.22,0:06:44.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wow, there's so many people!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.90,0:06:47.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Of course, it's a university. They always have this many. 
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.86,0:06:51.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder how many of Yomogi you could fit in here? 
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.64,0:06:52.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You can't even compare them! 
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.21,0:06:58.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Just hurry up and find him. 
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.10,0:06:59.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay, Ioryogi! 
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.56,0:07:03.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Um... 
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.57,0:07:08.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Um... 
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.63,0:07:14.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, I'm sorry! 
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.24,0:07:20.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Er, um, huh? 
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.00,0:07:22.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't get yourself lost! 
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.72,0:07:27.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I can't find Fujimoto. 
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.73,0:07:31.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're just wandering the halls! 
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.93,0:07:35.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll try my best! ... Huh? 
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.86,0:07:39.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's Fujimoto! 
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.11,0:07:46.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What are you spacing out for? 
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.20,0:07:52.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's right!  I have to give it to him!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.36,0:07:56.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't fall over again! 
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.15,0:08:04.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, are you okay? 
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.55,0:08:05.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.25,0:08:09.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry too! 
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.11,0:08:11.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Nah, I'm fine. 
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.52,0:08:13.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's a cute stuffed animal you have. 
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.32,0:08:13.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.49,0:08:16.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, thanks! 
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.02,0:08:19.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you a friend of Kiyokazu's? 
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.76,0:08:20.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No! 
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.94,0:08:24.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No... Not really a friend, just, uh... 
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.32,0:08:26.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Something like that? 
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.61,0:08:28.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, I guess. 
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.83,0:08:30.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Me too. 
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.42,0:08:32.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're...? 
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.61,0:08:36.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm Domoto Takashi. And you are{\fscx200}-{\fscx100}? 
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.41,0:08:39.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Pleased to meet you! I'm Hanato Kobato! 
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.59,0:08:42.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I came to bring Fujimoto something he'd forgotten... 
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.66,0:08:44.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto! 
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.82,0:08:49.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? He was just here. 
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.84,0:08:51.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He must've run away. 
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.60,0:08:55.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I ticked him off earlier. 
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.88,0:08:57.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Again? 
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.51,0:08:58.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"Again"? 
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.47,0:09:01.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He gets angry so fast! 
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.68,0:09:06.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But it's because I always screw up so much... 
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.93,0:09:09.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I still think he gets angry too often, though! 
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.26,0:09:15.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But it's always my fault, not his... 
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.47,0:09:23.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I see, you're the one from Yomogi Nursery. 
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.03,0:09:25.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah! I help out there. 
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.36,0:09:30.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,All right, Kobato, let's go look for Kiyokazu. 
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.09,0:09:32.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you sure you want to look for Fujimoto? 
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.28,0:09:34.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What, you think I'll get in the way? 
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.86,0:09:37.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No, no, you'll be a great help! 
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.33,0:09:39.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's great. 
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.03,0:10:01.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hm, he's probably in Philosophy of Law right now. 
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.50,0:10:05.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's okay, I think he'll be here all day. 
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.08,0:10:09.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He's finally taking a day off from work.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.25,0:10:10.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Really? 
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.21,0:10:12.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, exams are coming up. 
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.18,0:10:17.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He always seems so busy. 
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.26,0:10:24.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, he always talks big about taking extra classes, but then he puts his work first. 
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.06,0:10:28.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh well, that's just how he is. 
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.90,0:10:32.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Domoto! Give me a hand! 
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.04,0:10:32.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's up? 
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.86,0:10:34.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Can you help me out?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.60,0:10:38.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't even know where to start on Professor Hayakawa's report! 
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.81,0:10:41.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He assigned it for next week out of nowhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.55,0:10:43.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Fine, fine, okay. 
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.78,0:10:44.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,All right! 
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.82,0:10:46.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks, Domoto! 
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.66,0:10:50.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll help out, but you need to do the real work. 
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.64,0:10:52.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Fine, whatever! 
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.28,0:10:53.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks! 
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.14,0:10:55.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh man... 
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.68,0:10:57.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Anyway, let's get going. 
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.97,0:11:03.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto? I haven't seen him. Try the library maybe? 
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.97,0:11:05.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks. 
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.16,0:11:09.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If you see him, tell him I was looking for him. 
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.94,0:11:10.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No way! 
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.31,0:11:14.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He's so standoffish it's scary. 
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.52,0:11:16.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No he isn't. 
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.07,0:11:17.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Anyway, sorry, but I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.51,0:11:25.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Is everyone that scared of Fujimoto? 
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.24,0:11:32.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's because he's always so unsociable and angry-looking. 
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.24,0:11:33.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You too, Domoto? 
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.20,0:11:37.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You said he was mad at you earlier... 
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.81,0:11:42.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, he had reason to be. 
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.05,0:11:46.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He's always been the type that hates relying on people. 
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.83,0:11:52.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And I gave him advice on his future. 
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.51,0:11:57.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I ran my mouth, even though I knew he didn't like it. 
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.10,0:11:59.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Why? 
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.38,0:12:06.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, I can't just let him go on like this...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.10,0:12:09.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Miss Sayaka! 
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.99,0:12:11.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What is it? 
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.22,0:12:14.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Everyone's waiting! Let's play! 
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.28,0:12:20.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, I can't. Fujimoto and Kobato are both gone today. 
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.13,0:12:21.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll have to pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.65,0:12:23.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Fine then.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.50,0:12:27.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wait just a little bit, okay? 
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.35,0:12:31.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Miss Sayaka! There's someone here! 
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.77,0:12:34.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hi! 
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.89,0:12:37.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Chiho! Chise! 
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.52,0:12:41.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And Chitose! What is it? 
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.62,0:12:47.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We made macaroons with Mama, so we came to share them!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.39,0:12:50.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh my! 
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.78,0:12:53.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's eat! 
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.30,0:12:56.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,They're so tasty and crisp! 
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.22,0:13:00.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Where are Kiyokazu and Kobato? 
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.65,0:13:03.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,They both went to school today. 
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.45,0:13:05.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato too? 
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.02,0:13:09.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto? He left a while back. 
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.85,0:13:13.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Really? Thanks. I'll keep looking. 
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.06,0:13:15.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Domoto. 
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.43,0:13:15.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah? 
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.60,0:13:19.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Professor Tomita likes you, right? 
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.67,0:13:23.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Mind giving him a talk? I'm screwed if I flunk this year. 
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.05,0:13:25.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Have you tried going to him yourself? 
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.53,0:13:27.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Nah, I'm too afraid. 
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.97,0:13:31.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're on good terms with him, if you could just get things started... 
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.42,0:13:34.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Fine, I'll talk with him. 
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.45,0:13:36.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Really? You're a lifesaver! 
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.62,0:13:38.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But you've got to go to him after that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.67,0:13:43.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Everyone relies on Domoto, don't they, Ioryogi?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.67,0:13:41.81,Default-kobaalt,,0000,0000,0000,,Sure, sure. Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.44,0:13:46.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato! 
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.76,0:13:47.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry to keep you waiting. 
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.95,0:13:49.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't mind. 
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.49,0:13:52.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Mind if I stop on the way? 
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.37,0:13:53.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No problem! 
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.52,0:14:00.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Even if you say so, his attendance is a bit{\fscx200}-{\fscx100} 
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.03,0:14:03.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He understands that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.44,0:14:06.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Please, isn't there something you can do, Professor Tomita?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.56,0:14:11.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Fine. If you're that insistent... 
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.33,0:14:12.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you. 
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.79,0:14:18.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry to keep you waiting. 
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.09,0:14:19.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're great, Domoto. 
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.96,0:14:22.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Great? How?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.63,0:14:27.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So many people rely on you, and you're able to help them. 
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.59,0:14:28.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Really? 
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.01,0:14:29.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah! 
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.44,0:14:35.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I want to help people out, but I'm never quite good enough... 
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.21,0:14:38.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're wonderful, Domoto. 
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.50,0:14:42.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks... I guess. 
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.98,0:14:43.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? 
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.98,0:14:48.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Nah, never mind. Let's go. 
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.41,0:14:49.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay! 
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.24,0:14:52.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Rock, paper, scissors! 
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.77,0:14:54.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I lost! 
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.26,0:14:57.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay, Chiho's it. 
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.22,0:14:59.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Everyone go hide! 
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.37,0:15:05.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,One... Two...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.16,0:15:09.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So that's why she went to the university. 
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.37,0:15:12.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She was so excited. 
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.31,0:15:14.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's really like her. 
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.47,0:15:18.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Sayaka, take a look at this. 
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.86,0:15:22.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yukari! 
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.49,0:15:24.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Chise? 
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.04,0:15:28.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Which one are you? 
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.50,0:15:33.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Caught you, Yukari! 
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.17,0:15:35.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You were Chiho? 
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.92,0:15:40.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This is the person that said they'd be willing to discuss a loan. 
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.20,0:15:43.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This is an accountant I know. 
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.83,0:15:45.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And this is... 
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.84,0:15:47.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, Chitose. 
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.84,0:15:51.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Do you understand, Sayaka? 
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.16,0:15:56.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not helping you out of pity. 
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.93,0:16:02.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,My daughters and I all attended Yomogi, so we want to protect it. 
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.09,0:16:06.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So you don't need to apologize. 
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.57,0:16:09.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks. 
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.86,0:16:16.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,There you are! 
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.25,0:16:18.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's wrong with you!?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.98,0:16:23.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're just slacking off. I don't feel like helping you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.58,0:16:27.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If you didn't want me to lend a hand, you could've just said so! 
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.35,0:16:29.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Fine, I don't want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.96,0:16:31.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Fine! 
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.61,0:16:35.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You were no help at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.56,0:16:41.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What are you doing here? 
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.15,0:16:43.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto, you're a meanie! 
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.05,0:16:45.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What is it this time? 
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.20,0:16:48.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Why do you have to talk down to people like that? 
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.49,0:16:51.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're just trying to make them mad! 
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.44,0:16:53.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If I don't they'll just sponge off me more. 
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.94,0:16:56.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe they had a reason. 
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.70,0:16:57.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't care! 
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.17,0:17:00.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,They should do their own work. 
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.86,0:17:05.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I brought the report you forgot! 
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.26,0:17:13.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato... 
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.91,0:17:24.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I went way too far...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.04,0:17:27.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato. 
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.44,0:17:30.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Domoto... 
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.57,0:17:36.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh! You helped me find Fujimoto and I didn't even say thanks. 
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.79,0:17:39.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry. 
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.07,0:17:40.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Have a seat. 
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.96,0:17:48.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,How long have you known Kiyokazu? 
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.07,0:17:52.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Well... Since spring of this year. 
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.61,0:17:53.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Really? 
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.46,0:17:55.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Why? 
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.60,0:18:01.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Of the two of you. 
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.41,0:17:58.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm a bit jealous.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.43,0:18:04.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Us? Why? 
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.88,0:18:08.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I've known him a lot longer, 
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.44,0:18:12.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,but I can't be as direct with him as you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.25,0:18:17.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I must have made him angry... 
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.64,0:18:20.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I was so rude... 
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.28,0:18:25.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No, that's not it. You were right. 
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.13,0:18:29.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I just can't bring myself to be honest with him. 
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.57,0:18:34.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, I'm asking too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.50,0:18:38.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But you're wonderful in so many ways. 
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.71,0:18:40.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're so kind... 
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.97,0:18:42.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not kind at all. 
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.53,0:18:48.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But you're kind enough to listen to everyone, and help them out. 
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.05,0:18:52.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm just not good at saying no. 
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.96,0:18:58.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,They'd be better off if I turned them down like Kiyokazu does. 
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.86,0:19:05.79,Default,{flashback,0000,0000,0000,,You're just slacking off. I don't feel like helping you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.58,0:19:12.00,Default,{flashback,0000,0000,0000,,Kiyokazu's strong. He's not afraid of people hating him. 
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.97,0:19:17.66,Default,{flashback,0000,0000,0000,,People avoid him because they feel overpowered by that strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.69,0:19:21.92,Default,{flashback,0000,0000,0000,,I'm jealous of it. 
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.01,0:19:25.85,Default,{flashback,0000,0000,0000,,You're jealous of his strength? 
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.93,0:19:28.69,Default,{flashback,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. 
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.96,0:19:37.40,Default,{flashback,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know about Fujimoto, 
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.94,0:19:40.59,Default,{flashback,0000,0000,0000,,but being feared is lonely. 
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.34,0:19:43.68,Default,{flashback,0000,0000,0000,,Being hated hurts. 
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.43,0:19:50.96,Default,{flashback,0000,0000,0000,,Everyone you met today looked so happy when they heard you'd help. 
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.51,0:19:52.91,Default,{flashback,0000,0000,0000,,But that's just{\fscx200}-{\fscx100}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.91,0:19:53.79,Default,{flashback,0000,0000,0000,,Domoto! 
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.85,0:19:58.19,Default,{flashback,0000,0000,0000,,What's wrong with not wanting to be hated? 
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.05,0:20:02.68,Default,{flashback,0000,0000,0000,,What's wrong with wanting to be liked? 
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.14,0:20:06.67,Default,{flashback,0000,0000,0000,,What's wrong with wanting to help people? 
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.98,0:20:11.14,Default,{flashback,0000,0000,0000,,What's wrong with wanting to do something for people in trouble? 
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.43,0:20:15.30,Default,{flashback,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know quite how to say it, but... 
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.12,0:20:18.57,Default,{flashback,0000,0000,0000,,Domoto, you're a good person. 
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.71,0:20:26.62,Default,{flashback,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks. 
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.62,0:20:27.28,Default,{flashback,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? 
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.47,0:20:31.56,Default,{flashback,0000,0000,0000,,You're such an strange kid. 
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.37,0:20:36.13,Default,{flashback,0000,0000,0000,,Really? Did I say something weird? 
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.13,0:20:40.39,Default,{flashback,0000,0000,0000,,Ioryogi always gets mad and says I don't know anything... 
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.65,0:20:41.73,Default,{flashback,0000,0000,0000,,Ioryogi? 
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.46,0:20:43.27,Default,{flashback,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah! 
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.27,0:20:46.30,Default,{flashback,0000,0000,0000,,Ioryogi is a stuffed animal, but he can talk. 
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.30,0:20:49.01,Default,{flashback,0000,0000,0000,,But even though he talks I'm not supposed to talk to him! 
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.01,0:20:49.89,Default,{flashback,0000,0000,0000,,Hey... 
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.31,0:20:52.36,Default,{flashback,0000,0000,0000,,Is that Ioryogi there? 
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.36,0:20:53.24,Default,{flashback,0000,0000,0000,,Yes! 
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.24,0:20:54.53,Default,{flashback,0000,0000,0000,,Domoto! 
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.85,0:20:56.47,Default,{flashback,0000,0000,0000,,They're--{\fscx200}-{\fscx100} 
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.49,0:20:58.58,Default,{flashback,0000,0000,0000,,See you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.96,0:21:01.38,Default,{flashback,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah! Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.12,0:21:03.17,Default,{flashback,0000,0000,0000,,No, thank you. 
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.51,0:21:04.32,Default,{flashback,0000,0000,0000,,See you! 
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.32,0:21:05.36,Default,{flashback,0000,0000,0000,,Later! 
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.45,0:21:11.56,Default,{flashback,0000,0000,0000,,Why do I have more candy? 
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.35,0:21:17.04,Default,{flashback,0000,0000,0000,,Probably because you recognized that metrosexual guy's kindness. 
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.24,0:21:21.02,Default,{flashback,0000,0000,0000,,Metrosexual? You mean Domoto? 
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.02,0:21:22.38,Default,{flashback,0000,0000,0000,,Who else would I mean? 
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.38,0:21:25.84,Default,{flashback,0000,0000,0000,,Just recognizing it got me more candy? 
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.84,0:21:30.37,Default,{flashback,0000,0000,0000,,He was worried about what people thought of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.37,0:21:32.13,Default,{flashback,0000,0000,0000,,Really? 
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.51,0:21:36.74,Default,{flashback,0000,0000,0000,,Metrosexuals have their own issues, I guess. 
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.31,0:21:41.86,Default,{flashback,0000,0000,0000,,By the way, Dobato. About this afternoon... 
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.21,0:21:42.89,Default,{flashback,0000,0000,0000,,Yes? 
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.65,0:21:47.15,Default,{flashback,0000,0000,0000,,What the hell were you doing telling him about me!? 
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.15,0:21:51.16,Default,{flashback,0000,0000,0000,,But I didn't talk to you, just like you said! 
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.59,0:21:56.10,Default,{flashback,0000,0000,0000,,You can't go around telling people that stuffed animals talk! 
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.10,0:21:58.48,Default,{flashback,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry! 
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.48,0:22:01.23,Default,{flashback,0000,0000,0000,,30 points, Kobato! 
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.13,0:22:05.68,Default,{flashback,0000,0000,0000,,Come on! 
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.30,0:22:11.20,Default,{flashback,0000,0000,0000,,Didn't I already tell you thanks?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.52,0:22:18.37,Default,{flashback,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto's always like this. 
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.99,0:22:25.11,Default,{flashback,0000,0000,0000,,He's so awkward. He was trying to thank you deeply.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.43,0:22:26.41,Default,{flashback,0000,0000,0000,,Thank me?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.11,0:22:31.45,Default,{flashback,0000,0000,0000,,Is Mr. Kiyokazu done being mad with you, Kobato? 
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.45,0:22:34.83,Default,{flashback,0000,0000,0000,,He's not scary! He's kind! 
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.78,0:22:40.85,Default,{flashback,0000,0000,0000,,He's kind! When I lost my key, he found it! 
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.85,0:22:42.59,Default,{flashback,0000,0000,0000,,He made me a take-tonbo! 
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.04,0:22:45.60,Default,{flashback,0000,0000,0000,,He found me a cicada shell! 
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.98,0:22:47.59,Default,{flashback,0000,0000,0000,,He's not bad. 
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.44,0:22:56.04,Default,{flashback,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto is a strange person.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.93,0:01:25.81,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,{95 after the first frame of ribbon}What shall I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.81,0:01:34.11,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Even the obvious things are always so hard
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.11,0:01:43.91,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,I just want to grin when I'm happy, sing when I'm in love
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.41,0:01:49.71,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,They say my dreams will come true someday
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.71,0:01:57.47,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,but when will someday come? I can't wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.47,0:02:03.14,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Count one, two, three and spread my arms
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.14,0:02:08.35,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Gather the light to myself
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.35,0:02:14.65,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Where is it? Tell me what I can do
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.65,0:02:20.32,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Even if I'm hurt so much, even if I run so hard
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.32,0:02:27.04,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Even if I collapse crying over and over, I still
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.04,0:02:35.75,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,believe in my amazing future
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.06,0:02:49.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(1125,1125)\pos(424,166)}... A kind person.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.64,0:23:07.82,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,{14 into ED}People all want to fly
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.49,0:23:15.33,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,but they're cheated by gravity
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.91,0:23:23.33,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,everyone can really fly
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.92,0:23:31.97,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,She must be so unhappy because
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.30,0:23:42.98,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,she forgot her own shadow somewhere
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.35,0:23:45.69,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Then...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.23,0:23:54.12,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,If you tell me "thanks", if you say "thanks" and smile
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.12,0:24:01.21,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Going back and forth, we'll be happy
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.00,0:24:10.71,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,You'll be happy, there'll be nothing to worry about
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.80,0:24:14.89,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,As long as we're together
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.60,0:24:28.02,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,It's strange, I'm crying even though I'm happy
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.02,0:24:30.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(500,0)\pos(540,388)}... A kitten's lullabye.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.02,0:24:30.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(500,0)\pos(538,116)}Next episode
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.95,0:22:56.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,
